          "grid_price": "Prefilled with 0,35 €/kWh. Clear the field to switch the cost calculation off.",
          "pv_price": "0 = your own solar energy counts as free",
          "debug_logging": "Writes the state of both streams once a minute and every detail it receives to the log. Useful when the connection drops, but costs CPU and fills the log. Default: off."
